`{{ quality_config_path }}`

Hook processes do not necessarily start in this repository. A relative
`--config` path, including this default, is resolved against Claude Code's
`CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR` (the project root where the session started), because
Claude Code runs hooks in the agent's current directory, which follows `cd`.
Codex and Antigravity resolve it against the hook's working directory, so an
absolute policy path remains the most robust live registration. The
concrete tools and lowering policy are recorded in both the Pkl file and
`hookkit-template.manifest.yml`.
